      "body": "Hi Eddie,\n\nMy earlier note focused on client trust and communication. I wrote a short article on why AI alone won't make those processes reliable.\n\nFaster responses help, but someone still needs to own the next step and know when a lawyer should get involved. At Possible Minds, we're looking at those team responsibilities alongside the technology.\n\nhttps://getpossibleminds.com/t/NVEVq8yuQA\n\nAt Farah & Farah, would choosing the AI or making a consistent process across the team be the bigger challenge? I'd appreciate a quick take.\n\nBest,\nPranav\nFounder, Possible Minds",
